        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"57b1442f-8659-4698-8165-083c60c18221\",\"review_text\":\"Lovely\"},{\"review_id\":\"bcfce49b-6e57-4dd1-a552-c480c32fc2b9\",\"review_text\":\"The best music. Never let's me down...\"},{\"review_id\":\"2928d178-a338-496d-8f4c-5941a52329d8\",\"review_text\":\"I'm really tired of spotify getting rid of the option to listen to snippets of songs. How else am I supposed to find out what songs I would like to try listening to for the first time when all I have is the title and nothing else? Its ridiculous and absolutely nobody asked for this update. Please stop adding stupid stuff and removing the features that are actually useful.\"},{\"review_id\":\"a353d4fb-43cf-441d-adfe-99877ae05dab\",\"review_text\":\"Best experience ever\"},{\"review_id\":\"f925ca89-1106-4b3d-9fa6-8db04d5fa543\",\"review_text\":\"Nice one\"},{\"review_id\":\"be6cab6d-6495-4040-81a7-b4b85a2eeb6d\",\"review_text\":\"Good\"},{\"review_id\":\"e4371e2b-7208-4c1d-bec9-d4e6f860bf7d\",\"review_text\":\"No songs, only home option only their\"},{\"review_id\":\"0be7b8df-9bfe-4923-8b1a-676f43bac19e\",\"review_text\":\"New update sucks.. uninstalling this app and switching back to jio saavan\"},{\"review_id\":\"34602c83-961f-444f-834e-9d55d5efd474\",\"review_text\":\"Sportify is a very very. Happy spp\"},{\"review_id\":\"48d77b42-ca43-4dfa-b13f-756c03e4aa0a\",\"review_text\":\"This app now days making too much forcing me to buy premium buy latest update they remove previous song button song play customize button very very worst 😡😡😡👎🏻👎🏻👎🏻👎🏻👎🏻 better close your buisness 😡👎🏻\"}]}"
